{"surah":114,"ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"arabicText":"قُلْ اَعُوْذُ بِرَبِّ النَّاسِۙ","translation":"Say: “I seek refuge with the Lord of mankind;"},{"numberInSurah":2,"arabicText":"مَلِكِ النَّاسِۙ","translation":"the King of mankind,"},{"numberInSurah":3,"arabicText":"اِلٰهِ النَّاسِۙ","translation":"the True God of mankind,"},{"numberInSurah":4,"arabicText":"مِنْ شَرِّ الْوَسْوَاسِ١ۙ۬ الْخَنَّاسِ۪ۙ","translation":"from the mischief of the whispering, elusive prompter who returns again and again,"},{"numberInSurah":5,"arabicText":"الَّذِیْ یُوَسْوِسُ فِیْ صُدُوْرِ النَّاسِۙ","translation":"who whispers in the hearts of people;"},{"numberInSurah":6,"arabicText":"مِنَ الْجِنَّةِ وَ النَّاسِ۠ ۧ","translation":"whether he be from the jinn or humans.”"}]}